From d6a42c2dfb67a93971fbb48e38275bba8087cac3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jernej Skrabec <jernej.skrabec@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 18 Jul 2026 13:29:41 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 224/273] drm/sun4i: Convert VI planes to register shadows

VI plane updates currently write registers while preparing an atomic
state. That cannot work with DE33 RCQ, which must submit a complete
write-only register image at commit time.

Allocate shadow regions for each VI channel and its FCC block, and replace
plane register writes with shadow writes. The mixer commit helper flushes
those regions on engines without hardware RCQ.

Signed-off-by: Jernej Skrabec <jernej.skrabec@gmail.com>
